{% set speakingNpc = decnpc(npc.UUID) %}
{% set revealCandidates = ttm_get_reveal_child_secret_candidates(npc.UUID) %}

{% if revealCandidates != "" %}Available candidate fathers to reveal secret to: {{revealCandidates}}{% endif %}

USE WHEN {{speakingNpc.name}} (the mother) reveals or confesses the secret truth about a child's (born or unborn/pregnancy) true biological parentage to the presumed father, the biological father, or both fathers.
USE ONLY WHEN it is verbally spoken, not thinking, inferring, or realizing. When character realizes or thinks about the truth.
- When {{speakingNpc.name}} has multiple children or an unborn pregnancy with different fathers, specify the exact child and target father.
- If revealing to the presumed father: confesses that he is not the biological father.
- If revealing to the biological father: informs him that he is the biological father of the child or unborn baby.
- If both fathers are present, {{speakingNpc.name}} may reveal to either father or choose 'Both'.
NEVER use if {{speakingNpc.name}} is not a mother with an active paternity secret.
